<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">GUIYANG, China, August&nbsp;19, 2026&#8212;Full Truck Alliance Co. Ltd. (&#8220;FTA&#8221; or the &#8220;Company&#8221;) (NYSE: YMM), a leading digital freight
platform, today announced its unaudited financial results for the second quarter ended June&nbsp;30, 2026. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Second Quarter 2026 Financial and
