<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">As of June&nbsp;30, 2026, the Company had cash and cash equivalents, restricted cash, short-term investments, long-term time deposits and wealth management
