<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">In the second quarter of 2026, net cash provided by operating activities was RMB2,150.2 million (US$316.9 million), compared with RMB1,313.3&nbsp;million in
